## Module 3 — Solar Generation Simulator

### Objective
Create a live dashboard that simulates solar generation using a potentiometer.

### Hardware
- Arduino UNO R4 WiFi
- SSD1306 OLED Display
- 10k Potentiometer

### Concepts Learned
- ADC (Analog-to-Digital Conversion)
- Mapping sensor values
- I²C communication
- Real-time display updates
- Hardware resource conflicts

### Features
- Live solar output
- 0–5000 W simulation
- OLED dashboard
- Smooth updates

### Engineering Lesson
Avoid sharing analog pins used by I²C peripherals. The potentiometer signal was moved from A5 to A0 to eliminate a communication conflict.
